			<div class="content" id="post-content-4390840">
									

<p>This is a re-write of <a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20190331075312/http://www.scp-wiki.net/scp-517-arc">SCP-517-ARC</a> I actually started work on months ago, and it wouldn't have been possible without the huge amount of help I had from <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ihp" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1267048); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1267048&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1570902713" alt="Ihp" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1267048)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ihp" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1267048); return false;">Ihp</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dexanote" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(481882); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=481882&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1570902713" alt="Dexanote" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=481882)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dexanote" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(481882); return false;">Dexanote</a></span> and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/uraniumempire" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1613974); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1613974&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1570902713" alt="UraniumEmpire" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1613974)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/uraniumempire" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1613974); return false;">UraniumEmpire</a></span>, who provided so much crit and advice that honestly they should be credited with co-authoring the skip. I would also like to thank <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/roget" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1229263); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1229263&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1570902713" alt="Roget" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1229263)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/roget" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1229263); return false;">Roget</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lurkd" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1500566); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1500566&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1570902713" alt="LurkD" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1500566)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lurkd" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1500566); return false;">LurkD</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/procyonlotor" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(778357); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=778357&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1570902713" alt="ProcyonLotor" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=778357)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/procyonlotor" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(778357); return false;">ProcyonLotor</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tuomey-tombstone" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(462110); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=462110&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1570902713" alt="Tuomey Tombstone" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=462110)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tuomey-tombstone" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(462110); return false;">Tuomey Tombstone</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/chaosera" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2227264); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2227264&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1570902713" alt="ChaoSera" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2227264)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/chaosera" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2227264); return false;">ChaoSera</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/the-raven" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(174995); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=174995&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1570902713" alt="The Raven" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=174995)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/the-raven" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(174995); return false;">The Raven</a></span> and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mister-madness" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2253419); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2253419&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1570902713" alt="Mister Madness" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2253419)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mister-madness" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2253419); return false;">Mister Madness</a></span> For helping me brainstorm and offering even more crit. More thanks go out to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/thedeadlymoose" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(732274); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=732274&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1570902713" alt="thedeadlymoose" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=732274)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/thedeadlymoose" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(732274); return false;">thedeadlymoose</a></span> for giving me advice on writing about SCP-1000, and giving me his blessing to reference and crosslink to it as well. Thank you to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/djkaktus" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1888434); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1888434&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1570902713" alt="djkaktus" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1888434)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/djkaktus" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1888434); return false;">djkaktus</a></span> for writing <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/scp-2932">SCP-2932</a> which played a big part inspiring a big chunk of this rewrite, as well as <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/adminbright" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(224440); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=224440&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1570902713" alt="AdminBright" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=224440)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/adminbright" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(224440); return false;">AdminBright</a></span> for letting me link and reference SCPs, 001 this article, a big thank you to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/modern-erasmus" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3129691); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3129691&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1570902713" alt="Modern_Erasmus" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3129691)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/modern-erasmus" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3129691); return false;">Modern_Erasmus</a></span> for helping me go about the rewrite process, and finally, thank you to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/hk-016" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(172931); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=172931&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1570902713" alt="HK-016" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=172931)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/hk-016" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(172931); return false;">HK-016</a></span> For writing the original. I hope you like it.</p>
<p>I always liked 517-ARC, at first just because it was a big ol angry mammalian 682, then for its cool name, but overall because I feel like it always had great potential to be truly great. For a lot of people, it was the first scp they ever saw, surviving the Mass Edit, the move to this site, and even sinking into deletion ratings. I hope that I'm able to deliver on the core themes of the article, while also bringing something new, modern and interesting. I tried to differentiate it from a lot of the other monstrous SCPs by giving it an expanded history, as well as a few new bells and whistles. To reflect that this is the 4th rewrite of 517, I have chosen the number 4715, or in other words: 517-4.</p>
<p>The main photograph was taken by myself, and I also made the cave painting myself. As such, I give myself permission to use these images in this Scip.</p>
<p>The third image was sourced from the website Unsplash, whose copyright and licensing policy can be found <a href="https://unsplash.com/license">Here</a>. It was taken by the very talented <a href="https://unsplash.com/@jckemp">James Kemp</a>, whose gallery is FULL of fantastic photographs.</p>

